TEXT -992 -224 Left 2 ;Now no current flows through the transformer->\nThe current flows now directly in the ohmic short circuit resistance\nTherefore the load angle of the generator is now 90 instead of zero\nas in the example sgen_shortcircuit_NEW.asc\n \nYou can plot the powerlost of the earth circuit resistances\nby ALT/(ALT Gr)+Click to one resistance and multiply it by 3\n \nYou can see that the current at the generator is much higher if the \ngenerator is shorted directly at their terminals
